CREATE FUNCTION pg_temp.check03b(t text, payload jsonb, can_read boolean, writer boolean, admin boolean, admin_delete boolean) RETURNS void LANGUAGE plpgsql AS $$
DECLARE n int; inserted boolean:=false; newrow jsonb; blocked boolean:=false;
BEGIN
EXECUTE format('SELECT count(*) FROM public.%I WHERE id=$1',t) INTO n USING (payload->>'id')::uuid;
PERFORM pg_temp.assert03b(n=CASE WHEN can_read THEN 1 ELSE 0 END,'SELECT '||t);
newrow:=payload || jsonb_build_object('id',gen_random_uuid(),'user_id',auth.uid());
BEGIN
 EXECUTE format('INSERT INTO public.%I SELECT (jsonb_populate_record(NULL::public.%I,$1)).*',t,t) USING newrow;
 inserted:=true;
EXCEPTION WHEN insufficient_privilege THEN NULL; END;
PERFORM pg_temp.assert03b(inserted=writer,'INSERT '||t);
EXECUTE format('UPDATE public.%I SET user_id=user_id WHERE id=$1',t) USING (payload->>'id')::uuid;
GET DIAGNOSTICS n=ROW_COUNT;
PERFORM pg_temp.assert03b(n=CASE WHEN writer AND (t<>'activity_log' OR admin) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END,'UPDATE '||t);
BEGIN
 EXECUTE format('DELETE FROM public.%I WHERE id=$1',t) USING (payload->>'id')::uuid;
 GET DIAGNOSTICS n=ROW_COUNT;
 RAISE SQLSTATE 'PT001';
EXCEPTION WHEN SQLSTATE 'PT001' THEN NULL; END;
PERFORM pg_temp.assert03b(n=CASE WHEN writer AND (NOT admin_delete OR admin) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END,'DELETE '||t);
END; $$;
CREATE FUNCTION pg_temp.cross03b(t text,col text,payload jsonb,foreign_id uuid) RETURNS void LANGUAGE plpgsql AS $$
DECLARE blocked boolean:=false; rowdata jsonb;
BEGIN
rowdata:=payload || jsonb_build_object('id',gen_random_uuid(),'user_id',auth.uid(),col,foreign_id);
BEGIN EXECUTE format('INSERT INTO public.%I SELECT (jsonb_populate_record(NULL::public.%I,$1)).*',t,t) USING rowdata;
EXCEPTION WHEN insufficient_privilege THEN blocked:=true; END;
PERFORM pg_temp.assert03b(blocked,'cross-tenant INSERT '||t||'.'||col);
blocked:=false;
BEGIN EXECUTE format('UPDATE public.%I SET %I=$1 WHERE id=$2',t,col) USING foreign_id,(payload->>'id')::uuid;
EXCEPTION WHEN insufficient_privilege THEN blocked:=true; END;
PERFORM pg_temp.assert03b(blocked,'cross-tenant UPDATE '||t||'.'||col);
END; $$;
